[TITLE]
Synthetic channel burn and boundary replacement example (metres)

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CMS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
START_DATE 01/01/2026
END_DATE 01/02/2026

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Invert MaxDepth InitDepth Surcharge PondedArea
A 9.2 2 0 0 0
B 8.5 2 0 0 0
C 8.0 2 0 0 0
D 7.8 2 0 0 0
X 8.0 2 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
E 7.0 FREE NO
Y 7.5 FREE NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length Roughness InOffset OutOffset InitFlow MaxFlow
AB A B 8 .013 0 .4 0 0
BC B C 18 .027 .2 .1 0 0
CD C D 8 .029 .1 .2 0 0
DE D E 6 .014 .3 0 0 0
XY X Y 10 .030 0 0 0 0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Name Shape Depth BottomWidth LeftSlope RightSlope Barrels
AB CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
BC TRAPEZOIDAL 2 2 1 1 1
CD TRAPEZOIDAL 2 2 1 1 1
DE CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
XY TRAPEZOIDAL 2 2 1 1 1

[LOSSES]
BC .1 .2 .3 NO .002

[REPORT]
;;Reporting Options
SUBCATCHMENTS        ALL
NODES                ALL
LINKS                ALL

[COORDINATES]
